# Roadmap

## 🚀 Version 1.0 — Minimum Viable Product (MVP)

The goal of this version is to build a working platform with the core functionality.

### Authentication

* Email & Password Authentication
* Google Sign-In

### Developer Mode

* Connect GitHub Account
* GitHub Profile Analysis
* Repository Analysis
* Resume Upload
* AI Profile Summary
* Skill Gap Analysis
* Basic Dashboard

### Recruiter Mode

* Candidate GitHub Analysis
* Resume Analysis
* AI Candidate Summary
* Basic Candidate Report

### Shared Features

* User Profiles
* Analysis History
* PDF Report Export

---

